--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -21,6 +21,16 @@ The build will create two jar files:
 * the command line interface in the cli/target folder
 * the interactive explorer in the codeexplorer/target folder
 
+### Commands
+
+Run `java -jar sokrates.jar` without arguments to list all commands, and `java -jar sokrates.jar <command> -help` for the options of a command.
+
+* `init` - creates an analysis configuration file
+* `generateReports` - generates Sokrates reports based on the analysis configuration
+* `analyzeLandscape` - the landscape counterpart of the analysis commands: creates or updates the landscape report (`_sokrates_landscape/config.json` and `index.html`) aggregating the analyses found under `-analysisRoot`
+* `updateLandscape` - the same as `analyzeLandscape` (kept for existing scripts)
+* `updateConfig` - updates an analysis configuration file and completes missing fields
+
 ### Docker
 
